  "content": "\n\n<h1>加速附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fswiftness-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/swiftness-enchantment-data-pack?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>加速</code> 是一款全新的靴子附魔，共有四個等級，能夠提升你的移動速度。</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品箱或與村民交易取得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot swiftness_enchantment:&lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s swiftness_enchantment:swiftness &lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤／問題</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題或漏洞。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>💌 捐贈</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 捐贈</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 捐贈</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個相當耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，只需點擊幾下即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供全天候客服支援與迅速回應，絕不讓任何問題阻擋你！感興趣嗎？我們為你準備了專屬優惠方案！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\